menu "Zigbee coordinator"

    config ZB_COORD_CHANNEL
        int "Primary Zigbee channel"
        range 11 26
        default 25
        help
            Channel used to form the network. The S3's Wi-Fi sits right next to the H2: pick a Zigbee channel away
            from your Wi-Fi channel (Wi-Fi 1 overlaps Zigbee 11-14, 6 overlaps 16-19, 11 overlaps 21-24).
            15, 20 and 25 fall between them.

    config ZB_COORD_SECONDARY_CHANNEL_MASK
        hex "Secondary channel mask"
        default 0x02108000
        help
            Channels tried if formation on the primary channel fails. Default: 15, 20 and 25.

    config ZB_COORD_MAX_CHILDREN
        int "Maximum number of direct children"
        range 1 64
        default 16
        help
            End devices (battery sensors) that join the coordinator directly. Devices joined through a router
            do not count.

    config ZB_COORD_OPEN_AFTER_FORMATION
        bool "Keep the network open for 180 s after the first formation"
        default n
        help
            The SDK examples open the network after formation. By default it is closed again; joining is opened
            on request from the S3 ("Permit join" button).

endmenu
